chapter_notes.2B:
Bottom line: Chapter 2B for Nguyễn Phú Trọng in 2022 is a restraint-and-diplomacy record, not an external-war record. The public evidence I found is mostly about Ukraine restraint, UN-centered diplomacy, and the China visit/joint statement; I found no direct Trọng-attributed initiation of force, proxy war, or civilian-harm case in 2022.

